<title>USA: Welcome Home COO Thomas Hicks resigns.</title>
<headline>Welcome Home COO Thomas Hicks resigns.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, N.C. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Welcome Home Inc said Friday that Thomas Hicks, chief operating officer, has resigned for personal reasons.</p>
<p>The company said a search for an experienced COO is underway.</p>
<p>Welcome Home, a specialty home decorative accessories and gift store business, is operating under the provisions of Chapter 11 of the U.S. Bankruptcy Court for the Southern District of New York.</p>
